<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69603" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῶρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>folly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.146
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρίας πλέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1150
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				745
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρίην ἐπιφέρειν τισί</span>
			to impute <i>folly</i> to them, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.131
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρίαν ὀφλισκάνειν</span> to be
			charged with it, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				470
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδόκει μ. εἶναι ταῦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.41
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρίᾳ φιλονικεῖν</span>
			<i>foolishly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.64
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς μ.</span>
			<i>what folly</i>! <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				818
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ec.</u>
				787
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοῦτ᾽ ἀφῖχθε μωρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					9.54
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὴ μ. τοῦ διανοήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					818d
				</span></i>
			; of illicit love, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				644
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ion</u>
				545
			</span></i>.</div>
